  <description
  >CARES Escalate to Human. Creates one Case with the context the person needs (order, Stolen &amp; Delayed decision and reason, risk status, offer, customer choice) so the customer does not have to repeat the story. The description is internal: the risk status must never be shown to the customer. Any problem returns success = false and no case number.</description>
  <environments>Default</environments>
  <formulas>
    <name>caseDescription</name>
    <dataType>String</dataType>
    <expression>&quot;Escalated by CARES.&quot; &amp;
&quot; Order: &quot; &amp; BLANKVALUE({!orderId}, &quot;unknown&quot;) &amp; &quot;.&quot; &amp;
&quot; Stolen &amp; Delayed decision: &quot; &amp; BLANKVALUE({!stolenDelayedDecision}, &quot;none&quot;) &amp; &quot; (&quot; &amp; BLANKVALUE({!stolenDelayedReason}, &quot;no reason&quot;) &amp; &quot;).&quot; &amp;
&quot; Risk status: &quot; &amp; BLANKVALUE({!riskStatus}, &quot;UNKNOWN&quot;) &amp; &quot;.&quot; &amp;
&quot; Offer: refund &quot; &amp; TEXT({!offerAmount}) &amp; &quot;, credit &quot; &amp; TEXT({!creditAmount}) &amp; IF(ISBLANK({!currencyCode}), &quot;&quot;, &quot; &quot; &amp; {!currencyCode}) &amp; &quot;.&quot; &amp;
&quot; Customer chose: &quot; &amp; BLANKVALUE({!chosenResolution}, &quot;nothing confirmed&quot;) &amp; &quot;.&quot; &amp;
&quot; Internal only: never share the risk status with the customer.&quot;</expression>
  </formulas>
